Z||000007||1FST2M6||03-02-2000||08:40 PM||||I'm running a full interior! no a/c and many other things were sacrificed to the speed gods but gotta have heat and my tunes! OH YEAH!!! And my back seat holds a bobbing head Elias brothers "Big Boy" right under the 3rd brake light...    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">   not kidding it really does!  and where do i sign up to be in a sanctioned event.. since my car runs 14.7... (Atlanta International Raceway) I want this record... are you sure that 15.?? is right? And what does stock really mean?!<p>[This message has been edited by 1FST2M6 (edited 03-02-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000008||terryk||03-03-2000||12:21 PM||||Stock to me, means it has all parts bolted, installed, or laying in the car somewhere that came in it from the factory. No porting, polishing, balancing, forced induction, flames, bullet holes, German helmets, or Bigfoot gas pedals.||||reg||12
